---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') 
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1) 
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="via-ecosystem section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="glass-card ecosystem-box">
      <div class="eco-header">
        <span class="badge badge-purple">Ecosistema Pediátrico Integrado</span>
        <h2>Sinergia Asistencial: <span class="gradient-text">VIA+, Valeria+ & Lúa</span></h2>
        <p>Un recorrido asistencial continuo que conecta la valoración diagnóstica en consulta médica con la terapia diaria en el hogar.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="eco-grid">
        <!-- VIA+ Card -->
        <div class="eco-card via">
          <div class="eco-top">
            <div class="eco-avatar-wrapper via-avatar-bg">
              <span class="eco-icon-text">⟁</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>VIA+</h3>
              <span class="badge badge-cyan">SaMD Clase IIa</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="eco-role">Valoración, Audiología y Neurodesarrollo</span>
          <p>
            Herramienta clínica en tablet para el facultativo: 13 módulos de evaluación, biomarcadores acústicos validados contra Praat, y telemetría de usabilidad Zero-PHI.
          </p>
          <span class="eco-tag">Entorno Clínico Supervisado</span>
        </div>

        <div class="eco-arrow">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Valeria+ Card -->
        <div class="eco-card valeria">
          <div class="eco-top">
            <div class="eco-avatar-wrapper valeria-avatar-bg">
              <img 
                src={`${baseUrl}/assets/valeria_lua.png`} 
                alt="Mascota Valeria+ (Gata en Píxel Art)" 
                class="eco-cat-img" 
                loading="eager"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Valeria+</h3>
              <span class="badge badge-purple">Terapia en el Hogar</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="eco-role">Rehabilitación del Lenguaje y Adherencia</span>
          <p>
            Aplicación terapéutica offline para niñas y niños con dificultades del habla o hipoacusia: 9 bloques de ejercicios, protocolo con familias y formación en Academy.
          </p>
          <a href={`${baseUrl}/`} class="eco-link">Conocer Valeria+ →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="eco-arrow">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Lúa Card -->
        <div class="eco-card lua">
          <div class="eco-top">
            <div class="eco-avatar-wrapper lua-avatar-bg">
              <img 
                src={`${baseUrl}/assets/valeria_lua.png`} 
                alt="Lúa Mascota Física (Hardware ESP32-C3)" 
                class="eco-cat-img" 
                loading="eager"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Lúa</h3>
              <span class="badge badge-orange">Hardware AIoT</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="eco-role">Mascota Física y Silencio Clínico</span>
          <p>
            En consulta con VIA+, permanece en estricto <strong>Silencio Clínico</strong> durante la exploración para no contaminar el acto médico; en Valeria+, es el espejo visual del estímulo.
          </p>
          <a href={`${baseUrl}/lua`} class="eco-link">Conocer Lúa (Hardware) →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .via-ecosystem {
    padding: 90px 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ecosystem-box {
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85) 0%, rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.35) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .eco-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
  }

  .eco-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0.85rem 0;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .eco-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .eco-grid {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .eco-card {
    background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 270px;
    max-width: 360px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .eco-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .eco-card.via { border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan); }
  .eco-card.valeria { border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-purple); }
  .eco-card.lua { border-top: 4px solid #fb923c; }

  .eco-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .eco-avatar-wrapper {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .via-avatar-bg {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
  }

  .valeria-avatar-bg {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
  }

  .lua-avatar-bg {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
  }

  .eco-icon-text {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .eco-cat-img {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .eco-top h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .badge-orange {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
    color: #fb923c;
  }

  .eco-role {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .eco-card.valeria .eco-role { color: var(--accent-purple); }
  .eco-card.lua .eco-role { color: #fb923c; }

  .eco-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .eco-tag {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .eco-link {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .eco-card.valeria .eco-link { color: var(--accent-purple); }
  .eco-card.lua .eco-link { color: #fb923c; }

  .eco-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .eco-arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .eco-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ecosystem-box {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
